{"id":"event_redash1_02_s","cat":"event","group":{"id":"ev40031","label":"RED ASH · Part 1"},"label":"A Farewell Gift: A","stage":null,"prev":"event_redash1_01_e","next":"event_redash1_02_e","speakers":{"hongryeon_o":"Scarlet","redhood":"Red Hood","rapunzel_o":"Rapunzel","liliweiss":"Liliweiss","snowwhite_o":"Snow White","commander":"Commander","dorothy":"Dorothy"},"icons":{"hongryeon_o":"si_c225_00_s","redhood":"si_c470_00_s","rapunzel_o":"si_c966_00_s","liliweiss":"si_c943_00_s","snowwhite_o":"si_c224_00_s","commander":"si_c942_00_s","dorothy":"si_c233_00_s"},"lines":[{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_1","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_1","text":"Some hearsay hath reached mine ears.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":"BriefingRoom","bgArt":"briefingroom","image":null,"bgm":"event_bgm_redash_ashsmoke","movie":null,"shown":["redhood","snowwhite_o","commander","liliweiss","rapunzel_o","hongryeon_o","dorothy"],"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_2","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_2","text":"Any Nikke who is struck by a particular Rapture tentacle proceeds to undergo a particular affliction known as corruption.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_3","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_3","text":"They become deranged and attack all with reckless abandon, including their own allies.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_4","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_4","text":"I surmised 'twas but a fool's tale or nonsensical waggling of tongues, but...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_5","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_5","text":"How's it feel to know the legends are true?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_6","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_6","text":"It's that I cannot say. Yet judging by your countenance, 'tis not an overly treacherous situation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_7","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_7","text":"There is but an unnerving crimson that glows from thine eyes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_8","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_8","text":"Apparently, the symptoms vary.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_9","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_9","text":"There are times when they appear almost instantly, and then the other times they linger for extended periods, like myself.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_10","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_10","text":"We've actually just recently received some new information about that.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_11","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_11","text":"From V.T.C.?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_12","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_12","text":"Yes.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_13","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_13","text":"This so-called corruption phenomenon seems to be evolving.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_14","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_14","text":"In the beginning, it took time for symptoms to fully manifest, but the latest iteration takes hold almost instantly.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_15","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_15","text":"We've become aware that the device, dubbed Code Name: Ultra, which caused this corruption, is from an older generation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_16","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_16","text":"How long does it take until it assumes full control?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_17","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_17","text":"V.T.C. is continuing to look into it. They should have an answer for us soon.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_18","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_18","text":"How hilarious would it be if there's only a week left?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_19","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_19","text":"... That wouldn't be funny at all.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_20","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_20","text":"I know that. Sometimes you have to pretend that things are okay in order to get by.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_21","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_21","text":"But you're not okay by any stretch of the imagination...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_22","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_22","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_23","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_23","text":"Anyway, I'm retiring after this operation.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_24","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_24","text":"I wanna spend the rest of my life kicking back and taking it easy.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_25","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_25","text":"... Right. I understand.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_26","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_26","text":"So, what's the course of action, Boss?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_27","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_27","text":"We aren't really charging ahead without any plan, are we?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_28","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_28","text":"Tomorrow morning, we will go to Elysion's 3rd Nikke Research Lab.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_29","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_29","text":"We'll be picking someone up, and I expect you all to be nice to her.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_30","type":"Speech","speaker":"rapunzel_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_30","text":"Who?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_31","type":"Speech","speaker":"commander","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_31","text":"I haven't revealed this to any of you yet, but I have a daughter.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_32","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_32","text":"Excuse me?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_33","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_33","text":"Allow me to explain.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_34","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_34","text":"Apparently, the newest iteration of the Grimms model is complete.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_35","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_35","text":"!!","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_36","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_36","text":"It's referred to as Cinderella.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_37","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_37","text":"Her accompanying sidearm, Glass Slippers, is complete as well. She's undergone rigorous simulated and practical testing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_38","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_38","text":"We are to meet up with Cinderella and make our way to the Lift together.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_39","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_39","text":"Does Cinderella's ability have any relation to the operation?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_40","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_40","text":"Adding another member to the team is far from a bad thing,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_41","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_41","text":"but isn't it risky adding someone we're unfamiliar with? And on such a pivotal mission, too.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_42","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_42","text":"There's no need to be concerned on that front.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_43","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_43","text":"She has been designed to specialize in lightening attacks. Complete annihilation, done in as little time as possible.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_44","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_44","text":"Her capabilities are comparable to any air strike or ICBM. After she has fulfilled her role, she will take her leave.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_45","type":"Speech","speaker":"dorothy","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_45","text":"Is she really that powerful?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_46","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_46","text":"Apparently so.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_47","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_47","text":"The Big Three have pumped more money and resources into the Grimms models than any other.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_48","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_48","text":"In your encounters with Raptures, you're nearly undefeated.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_49","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_49","text":"As a result, Nikke production has largely splintered off into two distinct directions.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_50","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_50","text":"Mass-production types and specialized models.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_51","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_51","text":"Those who are deemed to be less self-assured are turned into mass-produced models.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_52","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_52","text":"Those who possess greater self-confidence and can better express their powers are eligible to become specialized models.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_53","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_53","text":"Manufacturing Grimms models requires inordinate amounts of money and technology.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_54","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_54","text":"The original plan was to veer towards increasing mass production, but since you all have done such a bang-up job,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_55","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_55","text":"the Big Three have decided to shift gears and funnel more money into building a second generation of Grimms models,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_56","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_56","text":"of which Cinderella is the first.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_57","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_57","text":"Her strength must be most formidable.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_58","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_58","text":"If we're talking about specs alone,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_59","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_59","text":"she most likely exceeds all of you.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_60","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_60","text":"Perhaps even me.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_61","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_61","text":"Don't say that. No one's stronger than you, Lilith.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_62","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_62","text":"Good grief. Do you really like her that much, Snow White?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_63","type":"Speech","speaker":"snowwhite_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_63","text":"I know I'm right.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_64","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_64","text":"If you want to be a capable fighter, you need more than just solid specs.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_65","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_65","text":"That's true.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_66","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_66","text":"So, according to you,","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_67","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_67","text":"her specifications exceed all of ours...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_68","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_68","text":"Then it would be advisable to practice some sparring with you all in advance.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_69","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_69","text":"Since we're on this topic, I have been itching to spar with you all for some time now.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_70","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_70","text":"Scarlet.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_71","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_71","text":"If it's a fight you're looking for, then wouldn't it make sense for you to best me, the leader, first?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_72","type":"Speech","speaker":"hongryeon_o","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_72","text":"...","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_73","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_73","text":"At any rate, that concludes the mission briefing.","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":"none","movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_74","type":"Speech","speaker":"liliweiss","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_74","text":"Any questions?","jump":null,"exit":false,"enter":null,"bg":null,"bgArt":null,"image":null,"bgm":null,"movie":null,"shown":null,"affinity":null},{"id":"event_redash1_02_s_75","type":"Speech","speaker":"redhood","key":"Locale_MainScenario:event_redash1_02_s_75","t